# The complete offline textbook is about 1.13 GB, so it is stored in Git LFS.
# Everything else in this repository is ordinary source and documentation.
*.html filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# The original source captures are the only surviving copy of the page images
# (3.5 GiB across 1,899 files), so they go through Git LFS as well.
*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# The preview index and the contact sheets are small derived files that must
# stay browsable in the GitHub web UI, so they are NOT stored in LFS.
docs/source_previews/index.html !filter !diff !merge text
